j\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the acquisition of the property is made under the Tenants Purchase Scheme of the Housing Authority; and \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 it is shown to the satisfaction of the Collector that subsection (2) applies to the conveyance. \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (2)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 This subsection applies to the conveyance if, on the date of acquisition of the property\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the transferee, or each of the transferees, under the conveyance is a tenant or an authorized occupant of the Housing Authority in respect of the property acting on his or her own behalf; and \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 that transferee, or each of those transferees, is not a beneficial owner of any other residential property in Hong Kong.\par }}
