0\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Where stamps are seized under a warrant issued under subsection (1), the police officer authorized by the warrant shall, if required, give to any person in whose possession or custody such stamps are found a}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 written acknowledgement of the number, particulars and value of such stamps and permit such stamps to be marked before their removal.\par }}
