t shall be calculated by reference to the point of time or the period of time which would have applied if such penalty had become payable under the repealed Ordinance.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (3)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Nothing in this Ordinance shall apply in respect of transactions referred to in }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 section 19}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  which were entered into prior to the commencement of this Ordinance, and the repealed Ordinance shall continue to apply in respect of such transactions as if this Ordinance had not been enacted.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (4)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Any licence issued under the repealed Stamp Duties Management Ordinance (Cap. 121, 1964 Ed.) in respect of the use of a franking machine and in force immediately prior to the commencement of this Ordinance, shall be deemed to have been issued under this Ordinance. \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (5)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Any assessment of stamp duty or any appeal against such assessment or any action or claim for the recovery of any stamp duty or penalty required or commenced under the repealed Ordinance and pending or not disposed of immediately prior to the commencement of this Ordinance, may be continued and disposed of thereafter as if it had been required or commenced 